<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" dir="ltr">
<head>
    <%- include('../../partials/auth-head', { title: 'Créer mon compte' }) %>
    <% if (googleClientId) { %><script src="https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client?hl=fr" async></script><% } %>
</head>
<body class="auth-entry">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#auth-content">Aller à l’inscription</a>
    <div class="auth-layout">
        <%- include('../../partials/auth-story') %>
        <main class="auth-main" id="auth-content">
            <header class="auth-topbar"><a class="mobile-brand brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">s.</span><span>synta<span class="brand-academy">academy</span></span></a><a class="back-home" href="/">↖ Retour à l’accueil</a><span class="topbar-note">Ton espace d’apprentissage</span></header>
            <div class="auth-card">
                <nav class="auth-tabs" aria-label="Accès à ton compte"><a href="/login" data-auth-link>Connexion</a><a href="/register" aria-current="page">Inscription</a></nav>
                <div id="authMessageMount" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
                <section id="registerFormPanel">
                    <div class="form-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Le début de quelque chose</span><h1>À toi de commencer.</h1><p>Un compte pour comprendre, pratiquer et progresser.</p></div>
                    <div id="registerGoogle"><div class="google-signin-container"><div id="googleSignInBtn" data-client-id="<%= googleClientId || '' %>" data-button-text="continue_with"></div></div><div class="divider"><span>ou avec ton e-mail</span></div></div>
                    <ol class="step-indicator" aria-label="Étapes de l’inscription"><li id="accountStepLabel" aria-current="step"><span>1</span> Ton compte</li><li id="profileStepLabel"><span>2</span> Ton parcours</li></ol>
                    <form id="registerForm" method="post" novalidate>
                        <div id="accountStep">
                            <div class="form-group"><label for="fullName">Prénom et nom</label><input type="text" id="fullName" name="fullName" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Comment t’appelles-tu ?" required maxlength="150" aria-describedby="fullName-error"><span class="field-error" id="fullName-error"></span></div>
                            <div class="form-group"><label for="email">Adresse e-mail</label><input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="username" inputmode="email" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" placeholder="toi@exemple.com" required aria-describedby="email-hint email-error"><span class="field-hint" id="email-hint">Tu recevras un lien pour activer ton compte.</span><span class="field-error" id="email-error"></span></div>
                            <div class="field-row">
                                <div class="form-group"><label for="password">Mot de passe</label><div class="password-input"><input type="password" id="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="6" aria-describedby="password-hint password-error"><button class="password-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Afficher le mot de passe" aria-pressed="false">Afficher</button></div><span class="field-hint" id="password-hint">6 caractères minimum.</span><span class="field-error" id="password-error"></span></div>
                                <div class="form-group"><label for="confirmPassword">Confirmer</label><div class="password-input"><input type="password" id="confirmPassword" name="confirmPassword" autocomplete="new-password" required aria-describedby="confirmPassword-error"><button class="password-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Afficher la confirmation" aria-pressed="false">Afficher</button></div><span class="field-error" id="confirmPassword-error"></span></div>
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" class="button button-primary" id="nextStep">Continuer <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
                        </div>
                        <div id="profileStep" hidden>
                            <%- include('../../partials/auth-profile-fields') %>
                            <div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-back" id="previousStep" aria-label="Revenir aux informations du compte">← Retour</button><button type="submit" class="button button-primary" id="registerSubmitBtn" data-idle="Créer mon compte">Créer mon compte <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
                            <p class="field-hint account-note">Tu pourras modifier ces informations dans ton profil.</p>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                    <p class="form-switch">Déjà un compte ? <a href="/login" data-auth-link>Me connecter</a></p>
                </section>
                <section id="registerSuccessState" class="status-panel" hidden tabindex="-1">
                    <div class="status-icon" aria-hidden="true">✉</div><span class="eyebrow">Ton compte est créé</span><h1>Un petit tour<br>dans ta boîte mail.</h1><p>Ouvre le lien de confirmation envoyé à <strong id="registeredEmailDisplay"></strong> pour activer ton compte.</p><p class="field-hint">Rien reçu ? Vérifie aussi les courriers indésirables.</p><a href="/login" class="button button-primary" data-auth-link>Aller à la connexion <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><button type="button" id="resendVerificationBtn" class="text-button">Renvoyer le lien de confirmation</button><p id="resendMessage" class="inline-status" role="status"></p>
                </section>
                <noscript><p class="message error">Active JavaScript pour créer ton compte.</p></noscript>
            </div>
            <footer class="auth-footer"><span>Un peu de curiosité. Beaucoup de possibilités.</span><a href="mailto:contact@syntaacademy.tn">Besoin d’aide ?</a></footer>
        </main>
    </div>
    <script src="/js/authentication.js?v=3" defer></script>
    <script src="/js/auth-entry.js?v=1" defer></script>
    <script src="/js/google-auth.js?v=6" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
